criptions.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Can I use a wheel for other food-related decisions?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Yes — pair Yes or No Wheel for quick cook-or-order calls with Fast Food Wheel, Restaurant Picker Wheel, or Drink Picker Wheel.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"} />



