      <h1>What's for Dinner Tonight? How a Free <em>Spin Wheel</em> Ends the Nightly Food Debate</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">"What do you want to eat?" "I don't know, what do you want?" If that exchange happens in your kitchen most nights, a free digital spin wheel can end it in under a minute — no app, no sign-up, no more standing in front of an open fridge at 6pm.</p>
